the paper never types a measured number by hand. Each entry of NUMBERS gives the
macro name, the results file (relative to the delivery root), a function that
extracts the value, and the format. CLAIMS.md maps each macro to the claim it supports.

usage (from the delivery root):  python3 paper/tools/make_numbers.py [--results-root DIR]
(--results-root: a directory holding results/, if it is not the delivery root)
"""
